          "start": 8,
          "duration": 7,
          "type": "explanation",
          "text": "WENT = simple past. Alone. GONE needs HAVE.",
          "voice_line": "Here is the rule. <break time=\"0.3s\"/> <emphasis level=\"strong\">WENT</emphasis> is simple past — it stands completely alone. I went. Done. But <emphasis level=\"strong\">GONE</emphasis> is a past participle. It always needs <emphasis level=\"strong\">HAVE</emphasis> with it. They are a team.",
          "tone": "calm",
          "stickman_action": "write_on_board",
          "stickman_emotion": "explaining",
