          "start": 15,
          "duration": 5,
          "type": "payoff",
          "text": "✅ I have GONE to the store.",
          "voice_line": "<break time=\"0.5s\"/> Now <break time=\"0.5s\"/> say it right. I have <emphasis level=\"strong\">GONE</emphasis> to the store. Or just: I <emphasis level=\"strong\">WENT</emphasis> to the store. Both are perfect. Never: I have <emphasis level=\"strong\">WENT</emphasis>.",
